  "notes": [
    "Observed live failure: 17 field columns all left at Start=0 in a single Row broke rendering for the entire flow, not just that section — this is not cosmetic.",
    "A 4th field on the same visual row means a SECOND Row node under the same Section, not a 4th column squeezed into this one — per-type width (Textarea/Attachment take the full 6, short types take 2-3) changes how many fit before that new Row opens.",
    "Row.Column here is the row's OWNING Section column, distinct from Row::Column (the list of field columns it contains) — easy to transpose the two."
